: run
:
# Link the src data directory into $~ and pass it to the driver.
# Trailing slash on the source keeps the directory attribute on Windows.
# $src_base/data is a real directory of per-entry upstream symlinks
# (build2#549).
#
# The driver prints a Success/Failure summary to stderr. Discard it
# at low verbosity, same idea as cJSON's 1>! for Unity stdout.
#
{
  ln -s $src_base/data/ data
  $* data 2>!
}
